                                                "sense_id": "30e0b2f3-957b-33b6-bcc7-0a91a7ad4a3f",
                                                "text": "“The Budget proposes to eliminate the Department of Agriculture’s (USDA) funding for water and wastewater treatment facilities because it duplicates the Environmental Protection Agency’s (EPA) State Revolving funds (SRFs). The Administration believes that EPA or private sector sources should fund this activity.”"
                                            },
