                                                "sense_id": "30e0b2f3-957b-33b6-bcc7-0a91a7ad4a3f",
                                                "text": "About $7.4 billion will be allocated to states, tribes and territories for 2022 – the first-year allotment of nearly $44 billion in total SRF funding over the next five years from the infrastructure law, according to an EPA fact sheet."
